                                "sense_id": "7d7d75bf-63eb-3bc6-9389-73020a2e3f3b",
                                "text": "We demonstrated a chemiresistive sensor based on core-shell hybridized nanostructures of Fe 3 O 4 and PEDOT for the efficient detection of VOC biomarkers."
